  "painter": "mix",
  "note": "Rainbow chrome that flows through the rainbow (MM2 Chroma style): a polished shaft running once through the rainbow from tip to joint with silky highlights, OpenAI forearm and sleeve of liquid rainbow-chrome ribbons twisting with glowing edges, a dark knurled grip with a rainbow sheen, silver collar and ring, a black end. Four colour frames, each a quarter further round the hue wheel, swapped by a script.",
  "ai": {
    "forearm": {
      "refs": [
        "closeup",
        "forearm",
        "full"
      ],
      "prompt": "Liquid mirror chrome in vivid rainbow colours (red, orange, yellow, green, cyan, blue, violet, magenta): smooth glossy ribbons of polished chrome twist diagonally along the whole forearm like flowing liquid metal, each ribbon shading through the rainbow, with bright glowing white-hot edges where they fold over and deep dark reflections between them. The two thin strips at the far left are the joint collar: paint them plain polished silver (#D8DCE2)."
    },
    "butt": {
      "refs": [
        "closeup",
        "butt",
        "full"
      ],
      "zones_px": [
        52,
        862,
        1336
      ],
      "prompt": "Left thin strip (the ring): plain polished silver (#D8DCE2). The wrap (from the ring to the next zone line): a dark navy knurled grip (#12162A), a fine diamond crosshatch texture with an iridescent rainbow sheen (blue and violet at the ends, green, yellow and red toward the middle), dark between the knurls. The butt sleeve (between the two zone lines on the right): liquid mirror chrome in vivid rainbow colours, smooth glossy ribbons twisting diagonally with glowing white-hot edges and dark reflections. The very thin strip at the far right: plain black."
    }
  },
